  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Realm on a path climbs a fixed ladder from ordinary to supreme grandmaster. Ordinary sits at the bottom of that ladder, below quasi-master.",
      "chapters": [
        687
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_attainment"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Among the five main levels (ordinary, master, grandmaster, great grandmaster, and supreme grandmaster), it is the first step.",
      "chapters": [
        810
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Most Gu Masters have only ordinary realm for their whole lives.",
      "chapters": [
        687
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "common-lifetime-height",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ordinary attainment is the level most Gu Masters reach in their lifetimes.",
      "chapters": [
        1326
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "common-lifetime-height",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ordinary sits below quasi-master. Fang Yuan’s qi path attainment at ordinary level is described as not even quasi-master.",
      "chapters": [
        863
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "below-quasi-master",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Most Gu Masters find it difficult to reach quasi-master in their lifetimes, no matter how much effort they put in.",
      "chapters": [
        1326
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hard-ceiling-for-effort",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ordinary is therefore the lasting height for the great majority of cultivators on a given path.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hard-ceiling-for-effort",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The full ladder is on Attainment. Neighboring steps include quasi-master attainment and master attainment. Dao marks and how they relate to attainment are on Dao Marks and Attainment.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
